 "Quotes, bookings and tracking": "Offertes, boekingen en tracking",
 "Administration": "Administratie",
 "Tell us about your shipment": "Vertel ons over uw zending",
 "Fill in what you know. The more detail you give, the more accurate your quote.": "Vul in wat u weet. Hoe meer details, hoe nauwkeuriger uw offerte.",
 "Your details": "Uw gegevens",
 "Leave this empty": "Laat dit leeg",
 "Full name *": "Volledige naam *",
 "Company (optional)": "Bedrijf (optioneel)",
